        <!-- ============== Architecture note ============== -->
        <mxCell id="lif-note-bg" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=#F9FAFB;strokeColor=#D1D5DB;" value="">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="1020" x="40" y="582" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lif-note-title" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" value="Parallel-MAC architecture (current):">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="980" x="55" y="590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lif-note-body" parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#555;" value="•  Each &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:monospace;&quot;&gt;linear_layer&lt;/span&gt; has P parallel MAC engines; outputs[] is registered as a full vector — no per-output streaming. Latency = 1 + ⌈N_out/P⌉·(N_in + 1) cycles.&lt;br&gt;•  HL1 and HL2 LIFs each share a single enable; all neurons fire synchronously when the FSM pulses it. Per-timestep ≈ fc2_latency + 5 FSM cycles ≈ 71 cycles (default).">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="990" x="55" y="610" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
